Targets: common
Releases: 13.0-13.16
Subject: Run modules that are linked into the server without the dynamic loader
Purpose: A static musl executable cannot dlopen(). The standard initdb needs plpgsql (CREATE EXTENSION plpgsql) and dict_snowball (text search templates), so those two are linked into the postgres executable and registered in a table that load_external_function(), LOAD and lookup_external_function() consult first. Any other library gets a clear error that names the built-in modules instead of a loader failure. Everything is behind PG_STATIC_MODULES, so without that define the code is upstream's. This variant is for 9.5, where dfmgr.c includes storage/shmem.h in front of utils/dynamic_loader.h, so the first hunk of dfmgr.c has other lines around it (one line of context here); the sibling for 9.0 to 9.4 is capped at 9.4.26. This variant is for 10: lookup_external_function() takes a const funcname and calls pg_dlsym() with a cast, so its hunk has other lines; the sibling for 9.5 and 9.6 is capped at 9.6.24. This variant is for 12: the link line of src/backend/Makefile has the objects in another place and lookup_external_function() calls dlsym() directly, so those two hunks have other lines; the sibling for 10 and 11 is capped at 11.22. This variant is for 13, whose object list of src/backend/utils/fmgr/Makefile is one object a line: the hunk adds a line of its own after the list; the sibling for 10 to 12 is capped at 12.22.
Components: src/backend/utils/fmgr/dfmgr.c, src/backend/utils/fmgr/staticmods.c (new), src/include/utils/static_modules.h (new), src/backend/utils/fmgr/Makefile, src/backend/Makefile (STATIC_MODULE_OBJS link input)
Checks: scripts/build-native.sh links the modules (symbols renamed with objcopy) and ./dcb musl make native-test runs initdb and CREATE EXTENSION/LANGUAGE plpgsql, a snowball text search, and the missing-module error against the static server
Origin: own

diff --git a/src/backend/Makefile b/src/backend/Makefile
--- a/src/backend/Makefile
+++ b/src/backend/Makefile
@@ -61,3 +61,4 @@
 
-postgres: $(OBJS)
+# STATIC_MODULE_OBJS: extra objects (modules built into a static server), empty by default
+postgres: $(OBJS) $(STATIC_MODULE_OBJS)
 	$(CC) $(CFLAGS) $(call expand_subsys,$^) $(LDFLAGS) $(LDFLAGS_EX) $(export_dynamic) $(LIBS) -o $@
